but we're excelsior now --

186
00:05:53,020 --> 00:05:54,210
当然要有尊贵的样子
might as well look it.

187
00:05:54,210 --> 00:05:56,480
很多年前 杰在拉斯维杰斯时
Many years ago, when Jay was in Las Vegas,

188
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,000
买了巴克利
he bought Barkley,

189
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,710
那个狗管家
the doggy butler.

190
00:06:00,150 --> 00:06:01,570
我恨死巴克利了
I hate Barkley.

191
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:03,270
我知道如果杰看到丽巴卡
I knew if Jay saw Rebarka,

192
00:06:03,270 --> 00:06:04,950
他也会想买的
he would want her too.

193
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:08,000
是的 那是她的名字 丽巴卡
Yeah, that's her name -- Rebarka.

194
00:06:08,350 --> 00:06:09,410
但是 那个
Uh, but, uh -- you know,

195
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:10,650
如果我们要去赌博
if we're going to gamble,

196
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:12,370
也许我需要那件幸运毛衣
maybe I need my lucky sweater.

197
00:06:12,370 --> 00:06:14,360
你能去房间里帮我拿来吗
Can you go and get it in the room?

198
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,860
你怎么还有幸运毛衣
Who has a lucky sweater?

199
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:18,190
你看超级杯赛时还穿两只不一样的鞋呢
You wore two different shoes to watch the Super Bowl.

200
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:19,130
好吧
Fine.

201
00:06:19,130 --> 00:06:20,420
别 杰
No, Jay!

202
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:21,660
走那边
Other way.

203
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,120
我喜欢那边
I like that way.

204
00:06:26,810 --> 00:06:28,410
不好意思先生 这是私人电梯
Sorry, sir. This is a private elevator.

205
00:06:28,410 --> 00:06:29,750
不用道歉
No need to apologize.

206
00:06:29,750 --> 00:06:31,660
我很高兴你业务熟练
I'm glad you're on top of this stuff.

207
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:34,210
您的卡只能到达尊贵客户层
That's only for the excelsior level.

208
00:06:34,210 --> 00:06:35,920
这架电梯是去顶层的
This elevator goes to the top floor.

209
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:38,880
我以为尊贵级别就是顶层 62层
I thought excelsior was the top -- 62.

210
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,740
曼德勒海湾酒店有63层
Mandalay Bay has 63 floors.

211
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:42,970
顶层是高级尊贵层
Top floor is excelsior plus.

212
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:45,740
等等 他们可以上去吗
Wait, they're allowed up there?

213
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:47,250
他们穿的是粗布工作服啊
They're wearing dungarees.

214
00:06:50,530 --> 00:06:51,740
你妹
Son of a bitch!

215
00:06:52,390 --> 00:06:53,770
拜托 给我来个八
Come on, let me see an eight.

216
00:06:53,770 --> 00:06:54,910
我想要个八
I want to see an eight.

217
00:06:54,910 --> 00:06:56,090
七
Seven out.

218
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,710
抱歉
Sorry.

219
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,230
我们下把会赢的 宝贝
We'll get 'em next time, baby.

220
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:00,550
克莱尔 把你的钥匙给我
Claire. Give me your key.

221
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:01,980
我有个东西得记在你房间的账上
I need to charge something to your room.

222
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,040
等一下
Hang on a second.

223
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,680
四 点数是四
Four. Point is four.

224
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:09,620
好的 赌四和五在C和E上
Okay, odds on four and a five each on "C" And "E."

225
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:10,730
你刚才说什么
What are you talking about?

226
00:07:10,730 --> 00:07:13,140
是巴克利的女款
It's the lady version of Barkley.

227
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:14,170
我得预订上
I have to put it on hold

228
00:07:14,170 --> 00:07:17,040
这样杰就算看到也买不到了
so that Jay, if he sees it, he can't buy it,

229
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,670
然后走时我会把帐销掉的
and then I will cancel the charge before we leave.

230
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:21,360
赢家是 四 真不易
Winner-- four the hard way!

231
00:07:21,370 --> 00:07:24,210
太棒了 终于押上了
Oh, yes! Finally!

232
00:07:25,250 --> 00:07:26,310
能给我钥匙吗
Can I have the key?

233
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:28,300
不 亲爱的 你哪都别去
Oh, no, honey. You're not going anywhere.

234
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:29,880
你是我的幸运女神
You're my good-luck charm.

235
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,790
吹口气 美女
Give these a blow, beautiful.

236
00:07:38,990 --> 00:07:39,940
按摩得怎么样
And how was your massage?

237
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:40,720
太放
So re--

238
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,570
太放松了
So, so relaxing.

239
00:07:42,570 --> 00:07:44,690
抱歉我的按摩师一直在放恩雅的音乐
Sorry, my masseuse was blasting the Enya.

240
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:45,940
你接下来想干点什么呢
So, what are you gonna do next?

241
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:47,040
泡个澡
A long soak?

242
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,960
还是蒸个桑拿
A long sauna?

243
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,930
我想蒸桑拿
I think a sauna.

244
00:07:48,930 --> 00:07:50,470
是吗 我想泡个澡
Yeah, I think I'm gonna do a soak.

245
00:07:50,470 --> 00:07:51,500
泡澡也不错
Ooh, a soak does sound nice.

246
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:52,820
要不我还是蒸桑拿吧
Maybe I'll do a sauna.

247
00:07:52,850 --> 00:07:54,810
你脸上那是亮粉吗
Is that-- is that glitter on your face?

248
00:07:55,910 --> 00:07:58,080
是啊 我的按摩师可能夜间兼职
Yeah, I think my masseuse might moonlight.

249
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,990
拉斯维加斯嘛
Vegas.

250
00:07:58,990 --> 00:08:00,140
-好吧 一小时后见 -好的
- All right, I'll see you in an hour. - Okay. Yeah.

251
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:01,490
好好享受吧
Enjoy it. Really have fun.

252
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:02,940
放松 米奇尔
Relax, Mitchell.

253
00:08:05,010 --> 00:08:06,040
菲尔 该你了
Phil, you're up.

254
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,050
好的
Okay.

255
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:10,240
化茧成蝶的奇迹
The miracle... of metamorphosis.

256
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,330
人们说唯一不变的是变化
They say the only constant is change.

257
00:08:13,470 --> 00:08:17,470
然而一切都将变 不同
Well, all of that is about to ch-- be different.

258
00:08:18,590 --> 00:08:19,980
注意这只是个粗麻袋
Note the simple burlap sack,

259
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:21,790
家里随意都能找到
the kind you'd find in any home.

260
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,050
可以麻烦你帮我一下吗
If you'd be so kind as to assist me,

261
00:08:24,050 --> 00:08:25,630
孩子
the-- the-- the Kid,

262
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:28,890
我要尽力证明一些变化是漫长的
I'll endeavor to prove that some change is glacial,

263
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:32,140
而有一些变化是瞬间的
while some change is instantaneous.

264
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:35,210
现在麻烦你把粗麻袋提起来
Now, if you'd be so kind as to raise the simple burlap sack

265
00:08:35,210 --> 00:08:38,170
提过我的头 在我手腕处收紧
above my head and pinch my wrists.

266
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,830
注意时间是4点02分
You'll note, the clock says exactly 4:02.

267
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:42,980
我的表是3点15
I have 3:15.

268
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:45,130
我的是6点35
Yeah, I have 6:35.

269
00:08:45,130 --> 00:08:46,620
凯撒杀手
Kaiser Mayhem!

270
00:08:46,620 --> 00:08:47,380
是我干的
It's what I do.

271
00:08:47,380 --> 00:08:48,230
等等 已经5点20了吗
Wait, it's 5:20?

272
00:08:48,230 --> 00:08:49,580
我得给我太太打个电话
I actually have to call my wife.

273
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:51,610
不行 菲尔 不能在魔术半途停下来
Oh, no, Phil, you can't just stop in the middle of a trick.

274
00:08:51,610 --> 00:08:52,650
这是基本的行规
That's a cardinal rule.

275
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:53,550
各位 这是紧急情况
Guys, it's an emergency.

276
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:54,390
别跟我说你们从未
Don't tell me you've never

277
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:55,540
不得不停下来打给另一半
had to call your spouse.

278
00:08:57,220 --> 00:09:00,320
你们 你们会找到另一半的
Oh...there's-- there's people for you.

279
00:09:00,490 --> 00:09:02,360
拜托 克莱尔 快接啊
Come on, Claire. Please pick up.

280
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,310
又是这位女士赢了
And the lady wins again.

281
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,200
很好 很好
Yes! Yes!

282
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,870
我做到了 我做到了
I did it! I did it!

283
00:09:06,870 --> 00:09:08,280
我做到了 我赢回了我的钱
I did it! I won back my money.

284
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,730
认输吧 豪斯
Oh, suck it, the house.

285
00:09:10,870 --> 00:09:11,920
克莱尔 钥匙
Claire, the key.

286
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,220
好的 好的 给你
Yeah, okay, here you go.

287
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:16,690
给自己买点闪闪的东西吧
And, hey, buy yourself something sparkly.

288
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,660
歌洛莉亚 我们上面还有一层
Gloria, there's a floor above us.

289
00:09:21,670 --> 00:09:23,580
-什么 -是啊 我也很震惊
- What?! - I know. It threw me, too.

290
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:24,910
高级尊贵层
Excelsior plus.

291
00:09:24,910 --> 00:09:26,210
但对于那层的人来说
But to the people on that floor,

292
00:09:26,210 --> 00:09:27,510
我们就是次级豪华
we're excelsior minus.

293
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,570
那上面有什么呢
Mm, what is up there?

294
00:09:28,570 --> 00:09:29,710
得拿黑卡才能进入
You need a black card to get in.

295
00:09:29,710 --> 00:09:31,810
可我们只有这破烂银卡
All we've got is this stupid silver one.

296
00:09:31,810 --> 00:09:33,260
我还以为是铂金卡呢
Oh, I thought it was platinum.

297
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,290
这是垃圾
It's crap.

298
00:09:34,290 --> 00:09:35,410
为什么
Uh, why-

299
00:09:35,410 --> 00:09:37,950
你何不打给你的朋友伯特
why don't you call your friend Burt

300
00:09:37,950 --> 00:09:40,170
跟他说我们需要黑卡呢
and tell him that we need the black card?

301
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:41,200
因为他不是我的朋友
Because he's not my friend.

302
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,660
我都没见过他
I never really even met him.

303
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:45,310
我可能就在一次电话会议上听到过他咳嗽
I think I heard him cough one time on a conference call.

304
00:09:45,310 --> 00:09:46,890
不知道他为什么要这么对我
I don't know why he would treat me this way.

305
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:49,050
-不是吧 -怎么了
- Oh, come on! - What?

306
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:52,690
不是吧 你是杰·普里契特
Oh, come on! You're Jay Pritchett!

307
00:09:52,690 --> 00:09:54,230
你要找到你的朋友伯特
You're gonna find your friend Burt

308
00:09:54,230 --> 00:09:55,250
告诉他你是谁
and tell him who you are,

309
00:09:55,250 --> 00:09:57,020
你会要到黑卡
and you're gonna get the black card,

310
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:58,620
因为当你决定做一件事
because when you set your mind on something,

311
00:09:58,630 --> 00:10:00,120
没人能阻止你
nobody can stop you!

312
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,680
没错
Right!

313
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:01,790
等等
Wait!

314
00:10:01,990 --> 00:10:03,210
从那边走
Go that way.

315
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:06,700
不好意思
Excuse me,

316
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:09,130
橱窗里那只狗多少钱
how much is that doggy in the window?

317
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:16,170
我终于从赌城手里拿回了属于我的东西
I had finally taken back from Vegas what Vegas took from me.

318
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:19,380
那种满足感很难形容
That's a feeling of satisfaction I can't describe...

319
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:21,210
因为没持续太久
Because it didn't last very long.

320
00:10:21,210 --> 00:10:22,290
-克莱尔 -什么事
- Oh, hey, Claire. - Yeah?

321
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:24,060
-你看到小卡了吗 -没有
- Have you seen Cam? - No.

322
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:26,970
我们应该呆在一个地方好让他找到我们
Although...we should stay in one place so he can find us.

323
00:10:26,970 --> 00:10:28,640
找个二十一点牌桌怎么样
How about a blackjack table?

324
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,790
不 我刚做完按摩和桑拿 很困
Oh, no, I'm really worn out from my massage, the sauna...

325
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:33,790
排出了很多毒素
It was just-- it was a lot of detoxing.

326
00:10:33,790 --> 00:10:34,880
知道你需要什么吗
You know what you need?

327
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,990
-来点毒素 -不
- Some toxing. - No.

328
00:10:35,990 --> 00:10:38,250
玩几盘二十一点 再喝几杯龙舌兰
Hand of blackjack, couple of tequilas.

329
00:10:38,250 --> 00:10:40,960
来嘛 可好玩了 快去
Come on, it'll be fun. Do it.

330
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,170
你听起来就像小时候
You sound just like the kid who bullied me

331
00:10:42,170 --> 00:10:43,800
逼我抽第一支烟那个人
into smoking my first cigarette.

332
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,440
也许这次你不会告发我
Maybe this time you won't tell on me.

333
00:10:45,450 --> 00:10:46,570
-继续拿牌 -好
- And then hit. - Yes.

334
00:10:46,570 --> 00:10:48,730
继续拿牌 然后停牌
And then hit. And then stay.

335
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:50,470
-我知道怎么玩 -好吧
- I know. I have it. - Okay.

336
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:54,290
你赢面很大
You are in a great position right now.

337
00:10:54,300 --> 00:10:56,350
庄家是二十一点
Oh, the dealer has 21.

338
00:10:56,350 --> 00:10:57,200
她的牌更好
Hers is better.

339
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,770
真不好意思 米奇尔
I am so sorry, Mitchell.

340
00:10:58,770 --> 00:11:00,290
可我保证我们刚刚每一步都做对了
I promise you, we did everything right.

341
00:11:00,290 --> 00:11:00,970
别太不爽
Don't be mad.

342
00:11:00,970 --> 00:11:02,110
-我没有不爽 -真的吗
- I'm not mad. - Really?

343
00:11:02,110 --> 00:11:03,850
我只是 只是太激动了
T-that was -- that was thrilling. I'm...

344
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:05,890
-我心跳加快了 -是吧 好玩吧
- My pulse is racing. - Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.

345
00:11:05,900 --> 00:11:07,470
-真谢谢你让我玩这个 -那当然
- Thank you so much for making me do this. - Yeah.

346
00:11:07,470 --> 00:11:08,820
我要再玩一局
I'm going to play another hand.

347
00:11:08,820 --> 00:11:10,000
我们要再玩一局
We're going to play another hand.

348
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,970
不是我们 是我
No, alone.

349
00:11:10,970 --> 00:11:12,270
-我不带你玩 霉运走开 -真的吗
- Not with you. You're bad luck. - Really?

350
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,750
走远一点
Go -- far.

351
00:11:13,750 --> 00:11:14,600
我一摆脱她
The minute I got rid of her,

352
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,010
就开始一路狂赢
I couldn't lose.

353
00:11:16,010 --> 00:11:17,690
赌钱真好玩
Oh, gambling's fun.

354
00:11:18,130 --> 00:11:19,170
还很简单
And easy.

355
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,600
你好 土豪哥
Hey, big spender.

356
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,750
你在干什么呢
What are you doing?

357
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:24,150
赌博 我现在是个赌徒
Gambling. I'm a gambler now.

358
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:25,750
-本性暴露了啊 -没错
- Look at you, letting loose. - Yeah.

359
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:26,540
我想通了
Yeah, I guess I figure

360
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:29,110
不管在赌城玩得多疯
whatever mischief one might get into in Vegas

361
00:11:29,110 --> 00:11:32,270
出了赌城就都不存在了
kind of remains here within the limits of the city, you know?

362
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,520
-这想法很酷 -是吧
- That's a cool way to think about it. - Yeah.

363
00:11:33,530 --> 00:11:35,420
我真的很高兴在这里碰到你
You know, I'm really glad that you came over here.

364
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:36,290
真的吗 为什么
Really? Why is that?

365
00:11:36,290 --> 00:11:37,350
我一直很遗憾
Well, I always hated the way

366
00:11:37,350 --> 00:11:39,310
我们当年结束得不太愉快
that things ended between us, you know?

367
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:42,190
说不定我们现在可以尝试好好相处
Maybe now we can go out on a better note.

368
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:43,670
-那样很好 -没错
- That's nice. - Yeah.

369
00:11:43,780 --> 00:11:45,250
天啊
Oh -- oh, my god!

370
00:11:45,250 --> 00:11:47,720
6-2-3-3 这是我的房号
6-2-3-3, that's -- that's my room number.

371
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,930
要牌
Huh. Um, hit me.

372
